  "move_pattern": "Starts with Pressurize, then cycles through: Stomp → Ram → Siphon → Pressure Gun → Pressure Up → back to Stomp. When triggered (low HP), transitions to About to Blow → Explode (which instantly kills the monster).",
  "powers_on_spawn": [],
  "notes": "Waterfall Giant is a unique scaling boss that accumulates damage through the Steam Eruption power stack. Each turn, most moves apply 3 Steam Eruption stacks (Pressurize applies 20). Pressure Gun damage increases by 5 each turn, starting at 23. When About to Blow is triggered (via TriggerAboutToBlowState, typically when HP is depleted), the monster collects all accumulated Steam Eruption stacks and converts them into final Explode damage before instantly killing itself. Stomp applies 1 Weak to the player. Siphon heals for 15 per player in combat."
